From a0aa57966cdf731dd265d0de7b29f4750fc61e4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:02:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native ABC subscriber, entry points and in-process
 /chronik

Wire the native Chronik into the node:

- hosts/abc/abc_entry.cpp: the chronik::Start/Interrupt/Stop entry
  points of chronik-cpp/chronik.h (init.cpp is unchanged), a port of
  ParseChronikParams and try_setup_chronik minus Electrum and plugins:
  the same argument checks and error texts; any -chronikelectrum*
  argument is an init error ("Electrum is not supported by the native
  Chronik implementation"). Only the selected storage backends are
  linked and registered.
- hosts/abc/abc_subscriber.cpp: port of chronik_validationinterface.cpp
  (the bounded, fail-closed worker queue; assumed-valid events
  skipped), feeding the Service; failures abort like ok_or_abort.
- hosts/abc/abc_http.cpp and src/httpserver: SetChronikInProcessHandlers.
  When set (native), /chronik requests and /chronik/ws upgrades are
  served in process on the query pool instead of being proxied to the
  Chronik listener; the proxy remains for the Rust implementation.
  Public-prefix and -rpcallowip rules, TLS, zstd and the response cap
  stay the HTTP server's. WebSocket sessions get the real client
  address, so -chronikmaxsubsperip keys on it rather than on loopback.
- init.cpp: hidden -chronikqueryworkers (native only).

Tier: eCash

Coordinator integration provenance (metrics369):
Bind native ABC node-metrics callbacks at startup; portable core remains host-neutral. Document actual native timing boundaries and shutdown: metrics allocated through exit; workers/sessions drain; callbacks atomic-only/no registry or host/indexer locks.
All build/runtime/observer controls deferred by user compile-first policy; ordered source replay is not runtime approval.

Coordinator integration provenance (reference405):
Preserve earlier purposeful source repairs through downstream consumer/context adaptations; exact conflict ledger retained.
All60 authored input payloads retained, with prerequisite-aware same-purpose splits; distinct legacy-index and inherited CXX compatibility remain independent. Pre-format source equals exact403+all60 control tree95718fceff83364b74294a751bd752b2f1a4e384. Only pinnedRuff import/format cleanup follows. Original author commands/hashes are historical reference evidence, not combined405 approval. Reference OFF/native/Rust full gates are preserved separately; combined compile/runtime NOT_RUN.
